#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, mLoopOnGotoUnread)
#: src/ui/miscpagemaintab.ui:67
msgctxt "what's this help"
msgid ""
"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/"
